Ghetsis: Indeed...{VAR BE01}
No matter. We already have an
exceptional base of operations.{VAR BE01}
Is everyone familiar with the legend
of the founding of the Unova region?{VAR BE01}

Ghetsis: The truth is this...{VAR BE01}
The white dragon appeared before a hero
who sought the true way to knit together{VAR BE00}
a world full of many warring people.{VAR BE01}
This white Dragon-type Pokémon shared
its knowledge--and bared its fangs{VAR BE00}
at those who stood against it.{VAR BE01}
Together, the power of this Pokémon and
the hero brought unity to the hearts of{VAR BE00}
everyone in the land,{VAR BE00}
and that is how Unova was created.{VAR BE01}

