I--I mean, Team Plasma--desires!{VAR BE01}

Burgh: Here in Castelia, we have
a lot of different kinds of people.{VAR BE01}
Everyone's ways of thinking and
lifestyles are very different.{VAR BE01}
Honestly, there's something about what
you're saying I don't quite understand.

Burgh: One thing we all have in
common is that we all care a lot{VAR BE00}
about Pokémon.{VAR BE01}
Even people meeting for the first time
can talk about Pokémon.{VAR BE00}
