Remember your speech at Accumula Town?{VAR BE01}
You were responsible for leading me to
rethink my relationship with Pokémon.{VAR BE00}
For that, I thank you.{VAR BE01}
At that time, I made a promise...{VAR BE01}
I swore to myself that I would dedicate
myself to Pokémon even more strongly!{VAR BE01}
What you guys are doing... Aren't you
going to strengthen the bond between{VAR BE00}
people and Pokémon even more?{VAR BE01}

Ghetsis: Myah-ha-ha-ha!{VAR BE01}
You are quite hard to figure out--a little
more intelligent than I'd expected.{VAR BE01}
I am fond of intelligent people, you see.
You'll enjoy hearing about this...{VAR BE01}
From every corner of the world,
I have gathered knowledgeable people{VAR BE00}
for our king's benefit.{VAR BE01}
You could call them the Seven Sages.{VAR BE01}
Very well! We will submit to your
opinion and be on our way.{VAR BE01}

Iris: Bianca!{VAR BE01}
Why are you thanking them?
They take people's precious Pokémon!{VAR BE01}

Ghetsis: The friendship between Pokémon
and people can be very touching.{VAR BE01}
But, in order to liberate Pokémon from
foolish people, we will revive the legend{VAR BE00}
of Unova--and win the hearts and minds{VAR BE00}
