Bianca: It's OK. Thank you, Iris!{VAR BE01}
No one was hurt. More than anything,
I got my darling Pokémon back again!{VAR BE01}

Burgh: Uh-hm. That's great!{VAR BE01}
Iris is a dazzling Pokémon Trainer,
but maybe not at home in the{VAR BE00}
